c regression and orthogonal polynomial contrasts\"},\n   {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"the best-fitting model was identified using sequential permutation tests in JoinPoint\"},\n   {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Differences between periods were tested using adjusted Wald tests\"},\n   {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Weighted analyses were performed in Stata (version 15; StataCorp) following NHIS analytic guidelines\"},\n   {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Estimates were age-adjusted using the 2000 U.S. population as the standard population\"}\n ],\n \"confidence\": \"high\",\n \"uncertain_fields\": []}\n```", "type": "text"}]}